{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_st01","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_st01","title":"一鉗之恩","storyCode":"WR-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st01.txt","sourceHash":"42d4954e9153d1b87abf582013db07b1f07ce77b7013fef4696054302b8ec976","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看二位恩人根骨精奇，一身正氣，又有一顆行俠仗義的難得心腸，必定是哪處的隱士高人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，一定是蒼天憐我，命不該絕......一想到那些兇惡畜生，我就氣不打一處來！不過是誤打誤撞闖了它們的巢穴，何至於此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好有二位貴人相救，我才得以順利脫身。俗話說得好，大恩不言謝，不如讓我為二位恩人算上一卦......聊表敬意，您看如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"要不你直接把那本占卜雜誌借我看看，正好打發時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"咳哼！啊哈哈，炎熔小姐，這就是您的不對了啊，所謂揭人不揭短，打人不打臉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"有話直說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，還是炎熔小姐您慧眼如炬啊！這不是俗話說撐船撐到岸，幫人幫到底嘛。雖然您二位幫我趕走了那些玩意，但不瞞二位說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我的行李全丟了。嗯，不光是乾糧和盤纏，地圖啊、帳篷啊、證件啊、換洗衣服和我心愛的小茶壺......嗯，全丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我的車都沉進湖裡了嘛，啊哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這釣竿扇子不是還在嗎，你真的是信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，哈，誒，其實其中有些隱情啦......反正騙不過您，那麻煩您就當我是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是希望和我們一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，我哪會不知二位有私事在身呢，我也實在是不好意思繼續給恩人添麻煩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"只是前路三百里有處村莊，名叫泥翁鎮，盛產美玉。那裡有一處驛站，只要坐上那糙椅，喝碗粗茶，打點一番，我就能重整旗鼓，再不麻煩別人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"一起走段路倒是沒什麼啦......不過現在那些鉗獸受了不小的刺激，攻擊性很強，真要一起走，也得等到它們安靜下來再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，給各位添了麻煩，實在不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那位叫克洛絲的恩人怎麼還沒回來？那些野獸數量不少，真不需要咱倆搭把手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真能幫上忙，之前為什麼被鉗獸攆著跑了這麼遠？老老實實等著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"可二位救我於水火已是大恩難報，再任由那位恩人獨身犯險，我實在於心不忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不如這樣！我這裡還有一本健身......不，是獨門秘笈，價值不菲，可有效改善身材，就當是給二位的報答！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"能停一會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，別這樣打量我，你還是想問就問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，二位恩人，看打扮，不像是附近村裡的人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆不是炎國人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那是來自哪裡？東國？烏薩斯？莫不是更遠些的，遊歷四方的騎士？我聽說異邦人總有這種奇怪的傳統，真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是......我......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"非要說的話，我是維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......維多利亞呀，嘿，那裡啊，我熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你壓根不知道維多利亞在哪吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，異國異事，也只有城裡的老爺們才會上心嘛，我們這種鄉野村夫，想那麼多作甚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"只是難得看見異鄉來客，恩人您一口炎國話說得又挺像那麼回事，我這才好奇嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（其實大炎話是臨陣磨槍的......算了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，克洛絲回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，克洛絲小姐，克洛絲閣下，辛苦，辛苦了啊，傷著了沒？要不要給您揉揉肩？敲敲腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡還有一瓶包治百病的祖傳靈藥，本來價格不菲，不過念在二位恩人的面子上，我就咬咬牙，白送了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......行李不是全丟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是還留了點行走江湖的必備良品在備用口袋裡嘛。欸，咱們老江湖都這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，隨你便吧。那前面的情況如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些可憐的小傢伙，幫它們找了個新家，就安靜下來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"這下我們可以繼續前進了，對吧？穿過那片蘆葦蕩，沿河而下，就能看見那座山了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，幫鉗獸找新家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正，解決就好，早點趕路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲，這個可憐的信使說要和我們一起走一段路，到泥翁鎮去，沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題呀，這次小炎熔是隊長，小炎熔說了算呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是隊長！失敬失敬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"失敬失敬~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你別跟著他起哄啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來剛才一直沒問你，該怎麼稱呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我一個小小信使，哪有自報家門的必要呢？您說是吧，啊哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過一直瞞著二位恩人倒也不合禮數，成何體統！嗯......就叫我......烏有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你絕對是剛想的吧！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有！怎麼會呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那個泥翁鎮，是不是在灰齊山的山腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"正是正是，恩人果然博聞多識！那麼小個城鎮都有所耳聞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是正好順路嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，烏有先生，我們保護您過去，不過到了目的地，您也得幫我們一個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！沒問題！反正車都在湖底了，等著救援隊幫我撈出來之前，我也沒什麼事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......俗話說得好，滴水之恩，湧泉相報！這麼快就有機會報答二位救命之恩，著實是老天開眼，老天開眼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"這副聲淚俱下的真誠模樣讓我想起了某些三天兩頭被扣薪資的人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，隊長，你決定吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候甩給我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！恩人呐！請一定要給我這個機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......有一個本地人的確方便些，年那個傢伙給的資訊本來就模棱兩可的......炎國的地理環境我也不熟，找一個人確實有點困難......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可露希爾為什麼要答應她做這麼麻煩的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"因為她最近意外的有幹勁嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"除了打麻將吃火鍋以外，她還做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，年小姐要是知道你這麼看待她，她會很難過的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"她習慣了。我也習慣了她習慣了。我只是抱怨一下她給我們找這麼多麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......抱歉，應該先和你分享一下情報了，烏有先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，恩人說的話，我保證都刻在心頭肉上，每天睡前念三遍，醒來念三遍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不用那麼誇張......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務很簡單，只是找一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個月前\n羅德島本艦"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，嗯，綜上所述，麻煩你們幫我把妹妹帶回來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"綜上所述個頭啊！你什麼都沒說啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼話，我不是說明過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"“每逢佳節倍思親”也算說明？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"當姐姐的自然會想念妹妹啊，這理由還不夠充分？平時你姐姐是怎麼揪著你的，你自己不清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"先不說你這個例子讓人更不想幫忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"——好，就算我當你家裡情況特殊，但從羅德島現在的位置深入大炎腹地，要的人力物力可是非常龐大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾不會輕易答應這種個人要求——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，她答應了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅答應了，還答應讓克洛絲陪你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，克洛絲大概是想去看看大炎山水吧，的確不錯，這段時間她沒少往那些烏煙瘴氣的地方跑，是該休個假了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是怎麼讓可露希爾答應的——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，別用那種看詐騙犯的眼神看我嘛，我這次可是真的為羅德島傾心傾力了一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......又給工程部添麻煩了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"如果給了他們價值千萬的實驗材料也算麻煩的話，那......確實呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"人類很難獲得這種東西吧，順利的話，羅德島從此以後可能會擁有比肩國家頂級精銳的制式裝備哦......順利的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你又做了什麼玩意出來......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"別問，一時興起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"我多年未見的好妹妹，夕。知道這個名字就行，到時候一眼就能看出來的，那就拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你不自己去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"她躲我那麼多年了，何必自找沒趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，雖然看上去你沒出多少力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然可露希爾都答應了......唔......事後記得好好謝謝我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這才是我的好炎熔嘛......不枉我特別給你的這身戲服改造了一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了......別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"給你的小禮物哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"《洪爐示歲》裡用上的那身戲服，你其實很喜歡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"瞎、瞎說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"可當時我明明看著你對著鏡子擺了半天造型？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......再不經同意進我宿舍，我真的會把你轟出去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，好啦，你穿著這身作戰服也有段時日了。雖然你還不能用匕首劃破空間呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那是你瞎改劇本才加上去的後期設定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？可從我來到羅德島到現在，你已經成長很多了吧？而且最近在教你源石技藝的可不是什麼普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，事情就拜託你和克洛絲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"以防萬一還是提醒你們一下，她......夕可不是什麼省油的燈。非常誇張的麻煩，你就多擔待擔待，以後我保證你打麻將只贏不輸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直有事瞞著我們，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......你都這麼想了，那又何必問我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"少來。不過我也不會刨根問底的，你和我們都不一樣，這點我還是能感覺到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，你還能在哪裡找到我這麼厲害的人？所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"就告訴你一聲，告訴你我是知道這事有多麻煩還願意幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"免得到時候，你的“報答”偷工減料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯，小炎熔也知道討價還價了啊，不簡單，不簡單......好吧！我決定了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"你把夕拖回來，我可以答應你一個要求。什麼都可以。比如......鍛一把神兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在有六種武器的想法，還差一個點子湊夠七種，隨便一把都夠你青史留名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那是啥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"厲害的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，你想要知道一些古老的故事......我也可以考慮告訴你們。雖然按理說不該讓太多人知道這件事，但要是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"誒——別這麼絕情嘛。你最近是不是對我有點不耐煩？不合適吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，這個你帶著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"你就當是......護身符一類的東西。畢竟我那妹妹嘛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......原來是幫同事尋找失散多年的親妹妹，這才行了萬萬里路來到咱們這地方，二位恩人，果真俠肝義膽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"佩服！實在是佩服啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......有那麼遠嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。前面已經能看到灰齊山了......但是天色也不早，怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我不急的，不急的，都看恩人方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"年給的地址，只說了在“勾吳城外，灰齊山附近”，這附近還有別的聚落嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！方圓千里，就那泥翁鎮一個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會住在山裡呢......畢竟是年的妹妹，感覺有可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......你對她到底怎麼想的，我怎麼感覺你也一點都不客氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"既然沒有更多線索，那就輪到你出場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！這地方我熟......別那麼看我啊，我真熟！小時候有事沒事總往這地方跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，這我可要給二位恩人好好說道說道，這勾吳城周遭的村鎮，想找什麼人，去茶館吼兩嗓子，認識的不認識的就都湊過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"給我半個時辰，妥妥地給您找著那位——對了，恩人要找的那個人，有沒有什麼特徵？叫啥名？是啥身份？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":".......她叫夕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是個畫家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，恩人，看見啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"居、居然真的在山裡......好累......這座山，怎麼感覺比看上去要高得多？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"意料之中啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這深山老林之間，沒水沒電的，自己建一間茅屋？恩人呐，你那朋友的妹妹，當真好雅興呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......不瞞你們說，我已經開始有不好的預感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這裡風景真的不錯啊。如果是畫家的話，倒也不是不能想像啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......？小炎熔？你在找什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"年給的“護身符”。我現在才意識到也許她給我這東西是別有用意的，而且多半不會是什麼好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那......丟了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲，你才是對她意見最大的那個人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，不如我先去問問門道，看看屋裡有人否，會不會找錯了人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒不用，只是覺得見她妹妹不能莽撞，得有個心理準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，有人在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"您好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"該不是散步去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"在山裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"可您看這門上水漬斑駁，落葉成堆，感覺不像是有人居住的樣子呀......敲門試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......您好？有人在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_2014_nian","aliases":["年"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["？？？","烏有"]}]}
